WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Editing day.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:06.370
Read each sentence with but or so, and ask if the logic is right.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.420
Caspian was tired, but he rode on.

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.700
That works.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.680
Caspian was tired, so he rode on.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.100
That doesn’t.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.600
One small word, and the meaning flips.
